{"framework":"vue","displayName":"Columns ▸ Column summary · Include nested summary results · Vue 3","tier":2,"engine":"container","sandpackTemplate":null,"sandpackEnvironment":null,"container":"vue","htWrappers":["@handsontable/vue3"],"entry":"/src/main.ts","htmlEntry":"/index.html","devCommand":"pnpm exec vite --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173","buildCommand":"vite build","outputDir":"dist","outputGlob":null,"staticExport":false,"spaMode":false,"port":5173,"installCommand":"pnpm install","htCoreRange":"19.0.0","fileCount":5,"assets":[],"skipped":[],"files":{"/package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"handsontable-vue-example\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@10.34.5\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"handsontable\": \"19.0.0\",\n    \"@handsontable/vue3\": \"19.0.0\",\n    \"vue\": \"3.x\",\n    \"vite\": \"^5.4.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  }\n}","/vite.config.js":"import { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport vue from \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({ plugins: [vue()], server: { allowedHosts: true } });","/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Handsontable Vue Example</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"example13\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.ts\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","/src/main.ts":"import { createApp } from \"vue\";\nimport App from \"./App.vue\";\ncreateApp(App).mount(\"#example13\");","/src/App.vue":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref } from 'vue';\nimport { HotTable } from '@handsontable/vue3';\nimport { registerAllModules } from 'handsontable/registry';\nimport type { GridSettings } from 'handsontable/settings';\nimport type { SummaryEndpoint } from 'handsontable/plugins/columnSummary';\n\n// register Handsontable's modules\nregisterAllModules();\n\ninterface BudgetLine {\n  item: string;\n  amount: number | null;\n  __children?: BudgetLine[];\n}\n\nconst data: BudgetLine[] = [\n  {\n    item: 'Operations',\n    amount: null,\n    __children: [\n      { item: 'Rent', amount: 4200 },\n      { item: 'Utilities', amount: 650 },\n      {\n        item: 'Payroll',\n        amount: null,\n        __children: [\n          { item: 'Engineering', amount: 18500 },\n          { item: 'Design', amount: 7400 },\n          { item: 'Support', amount: 5100 },\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n\n// Give every parent a summary of its direct children. Physical rows follow the data tree,\n// so the endpoints stay right while a group is collapsed. Returns the rows `line` spans.\nconst addEndpoints = (endpoints: SummaryEndpoint[], line: BudgetLine, physicalRow: number): number => {\n  const ranges: number[][] = [];\n  let nextRow = physicalRow + 1;\n\n  (line.__children ?? []).forEach((child) => {\n    ranges.push([nextRow, nextRow]);\n    nextRow += addEndpoints(endpoints, child, nextRow);\n  });\n\n  if (ranges.length > 0) {\n    endpoints.push({\n      sourceColumn: 1,\n      destinationColumn: 1,\n      destinationRow: physicalRow,\n      type: 'sum',\n      ranges,\n      includeSummaryResults: true,\n    });\n  }\n\n  return nextRow - physicalRow;\n};\n\nconst hotSettings = ref<GridSettings>({\n  autoWrapRow: true,\n  autoWrapCol: true,\n  // licenseKey: 'your-license-key', // get a key at https://handsontable.com/pricing/\n  data,\n  columns: [{ data: 'item' }, { data: 'amount', type: 'numeric' }],\n  nestedRows: true,\n  rowHeaders: true,\n  colHeaders: ['Budget line', 'Amount (USD)'],\n  columnSummary() {\n    const endpoints: SummaryEndpoint[] = [];\n    let physicalRow = 0;\n\n    data.forEach((line) => {\n      physicalRow += addEndpoints(endpoints, line, physicalRow);\n    });\n\n    return endpoints;\n  },\n  height: 'auto',\n});\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div id=\"example13\">\n    <HotTable :settings=\"hotSettings\" />\n  </div>\n</template>"},"docsPath":"guides/columns/column-summary/vue/example13.vue","breadcrumb":["Columns","Column summary"],"guide":"guides/columns/column-summary/column-summary.md","guideTitle":"Column summary","exampleId":"example13","exampleTitle":"Include nested summary results","docPermalink":"/column-summary","lang":"Vue 3"}
